		COMMENT Get a tag to sync to the client with ClientboundLevelChunkPacket, used for initial loading of the chunk or when many blocks change at once. This tag comes back to you clientside in {@link net.minecraft.network.protocol.game.ClientGamePacketListener#handleBlockEntityData}
